test('editing a Brief event requires reviewed saving of title/date/start time',async t=>{const s=await editableEvent(t);let writes=0;s.client.saveEventEdit=async()=>{writes++;return{saved:true};};s.review();for(let i=0;i<4;i++)await turn();assert.equal(writes,0);assert.match(s.root.innerHTML,/Save these event changes\?/);assert.match(s.root.innerHTML,/Approve event changes/);s.click('#private-task-create-approve');for(let i=0;i<6;i++)await turn();assert.equal(writes,1);assert.match(s.root.innerHTML,/Workspace event changes saved and checked/);assert.doesNotMatch(s.root.innerHTML,/private-task-create-form/);});
